{"text": "One evening her husband came home with a proud look and handed her a large envelope. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was an invitation to a grand ball at the Ministry, which he had worked very hard to get. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Instead of being delighted, she threw the invitation on the table and asked, What do you want me to do with this. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have nothing to wear, she said, and two tears ran slowly down her cheeks. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her husband had saved four hundred francs to buy a gun for hunting with his friends that summer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He turned a little pale, but he gave her the money for a beautiful dress. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> As the day of the ball came closer, Madame Loisel seemed sad and anxious again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I do not have a single jewel to wear, she said, I will look like a poor woman. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Her husband cried, Go and see your friend Madame Forestier, and ask her to lend you some jewels.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", "i", "n", "g", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "h", "u", "s", "b", "a", "n", "d", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "h", "o", "m", "e", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "p", "r", "o", "u", "d", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "a", "n", "d", "e", "d", " ", "h", "e", "r", " ", "a", " ", "l", "a", "r", "g", "e", " ", "e", "n", "v", "e", "l", "o", "p", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "t", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", "n", " ", "i", "n", "v", "i", "t", "a", "t", "i", "o", "n", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", " ", "g", "r", "a", "n", "d", " ", "b", "a", "l", "l", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "M", "i", "n", "i", "s", "t", "r", "y", ",", " ", "w", "h", "i", "c", "h", " ", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "d", " ", "w", "o", "r", "k", "e", "d", " ", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "h", "a", "r", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "